ntdll on arm64 macOS: TEB and PEB without x18 (TSD slot, page after KUSER), JIT memory
(MAP_JIT), exec env strings, CPU feature registry values from sysctl, signal handling,
and the free area search that skips host mappings in one step (no 64K mach_vm_map probing
under the virtual lock), and with NEUTRON_SANDBOX=1 a sandboxed client refuses a wineserver
that runs outside the sandbox (it opens files and sockets for its clients). Also the
ntdll parts of msync (0015) in these files.
